sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: One focused participant interaction
    accDescr: The initiator sends a request to an owner. The owner delegates verified work and returns a result. An alternate failure returns after any explicitly shown partial effect.

    participant initiator as Initiating boundary
    participant owner as Long-lived owner
    participant worker as Responsible component

    initiator->>owner: request(artifact)
    owner->>worker: perform verified work
    alt work succeeds
        worker-->>owner: result
        owner-->>initiator: completion
    else work fails
        worker-->>owner: error
        owner-->>initiator: error after stated effects
    end
